    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Arrive in Time&quot; is a minimalist casual strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to drive a car and collect stars within the time limit to pass each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >119 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 4-8 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >support keyboard&amp;mouse and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, relaxed vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only two types of actions in the game: pressing the gas pedal and using cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the entire game using just one mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Using Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to turn left, turn right, or accelerate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is crucial, so don't waste any card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you'll acquire more cards and items to help you solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't crash into other cars or people, and obey the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various obstacles that players need to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through levels, more new mechanics will be introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of Night Driving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's said that in some areas, drivers become tense when driving at night\u2014to the point of losing consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, try to stay in well-lit areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps buying a &quot;Ghost Detector&quot; from the shop might help you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Arrive in Time&quot; is a minimalist casual strategy game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to drive a car and collect stars within the time limit to pass each level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >119 different levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 4-8 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >support keyboard&amp;mouse and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gradual difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, relaxed vibe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are only two types of actions in the game: pressing the gas pedal and using cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play the entire game using just one mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/820152c308be42cd26d3767342b8d7bf.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Using Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to turn left, turn right, or accelerate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is crucial, so don't waste any card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you'll acquire more cards and items to help you solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/3f36b3edb6e84fb977f65b73cb25cf0b.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow the Rules</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't crash into other cars or people, and obey the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various obstacles that players need to navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you advance through levels, more new mechanics will be introduced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/e8620d978ed3a908545df3b4a56b0270.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Beware of Night Driving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's said that in some areas, drivers become tense when driving at night\u2014to the point of losing consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, try to stay in well-lit areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps buying a &quot;Ghost Detector&quot; from the shop might help you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.poster.avif?t=1740195296\" width=480 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.webm?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3071060/extras/600a67c8f2d35bb522ad1cdd262cd47b.mp4?t=1740195296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
